<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\ベンチ殴る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "雑談ゲージ" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{QUAKESTOP "1000"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"What have I been watching...!? It was all Shigatsu Youka's fault, wasn't it!? That thing...!"<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体春花悲しみ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"No... It was Shigatsu Youka's fault, but..."<PG>
"But everyone still had a choice left that wouldn't have caused a tragedy."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体春花目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "システム音\落ち葉の影.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
"Not wanting to lose someone dear. Wanting to protect someone dear. Because losing someone dear hurts. To run from the pain..."<PG>
"Dad used Droga to protect Sakura-san―"<PG>
"I cursed my classmates to protect Mom―"<PG>
"Mom caused the Megasawa City case to protect me―"<PG>
"Kotaro-san and Sakura-san sent Droga to Mom to protect Chiga-nee―"<PG>
"Mom killed Natsumi's dad so she wouldn't have to let me go―"<PG>
"And Kotaro-san, afraid of losing Sakura-san, gave in to Shigatsu Youka's temptation―"<PG>
"Everyone lent an ear to the devil's whisper. They wanted to run from the pain, so they pushed their own selfish justice through..."<PG>
"And that's why so many tragedies happened."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"I see... Kotaro-san and Chiga-nee, too, had been looking away from what they'd done... That's why that happened."<PG>
"But in the end, everyone faced themselves, and faced the people who held them up..."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体春花目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"But...!
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体春花怒り閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
　But that world is still too much for me!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "立木三日" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
